#. i18n: file: displayConfig.ui:22
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, contactsShowWidget)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"Enable this to show contact properties like their name, email address or "
"instant messaging status."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Kontaktegenschappen as den Naam, de Nettpostadress oder "
"den Kortnarichten-Status wiesen wullt."

#. i18n: file: displayConfig.ui:25
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, contactsShowWidget)
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid ""
"Enable this to show contact properties like their name, email address or "
"instant messaging status. Which properties are shown in which order can be "
"configured in the \"Contact Properties\" tab."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Kontaktegenschappen as den Naam, de Nettpostadress oder "
"den Kortnarichten-Status wiesen wullt. De Egenschappen, de wiest warrt, un "
"ehr Reeg kannst Du op de \"Kontakt-Egenschappen\"-Paneelsiet fastleggen."

#. i18n: file: displayConfig.ui:28
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, contactsShowWidget)
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Show contact properties"
msgstr "Kontakt-Egenschappen wiesen"

#. i18n: file: displayConfig.ui:38
#. i18n: ectx: property (availableLabel), widget (KActionSelector, contactsSelection)
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Available properties:"
msgstr "&Verföögbor Egenschappen:"

#. i18n: file: displayConfig.ui:41
#. i18n: ectx: property (selectedLabel), widget (KActionSelector, contactsSelection)
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "&Shown properties:"
msgstr "&Wiest Egenschappen:"

